{"version":1,"content":"<p>二十屆五中全會今天閉幕，並且發布會議公告，宣佈處理34名中央委員、中央候補委員，是文革結束之後史無前例。</p><p>這當中包括前政治局委員馬興瑞、張又俠，前中共中央對外聯絡部部長劉建超。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T10:21:46.536595+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":88,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T09:50:56+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T12:58:19.224880+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T10:18:14.307796+00:00","content_hash":"b9e79c5aa228381a0d0690644b2b0bf054369f8ec308e996b80d3d93d2fe1d5c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}